    "body": "Mechanism verified in production trace (FLOAT_CTX_CHILD mode=per-line\nfires with correct infobox reserves) and in 6 new unit tests. However,\nmeasured History position at default viewport is 2281.5 vs pre-ADR-079\n2210 — net ~0. The ~71px difference matches narrower-window wrap noise.\n\nRoot cause: ADR-074 Bug A. The infobox is placed at y=798, after the\nintro paragraphs rather than alongside them. Intro paragraphs therefore\nget no FLOAT_CTX_CHILD, and the wrapped paragraphs sit entirely inside\nthe float zone, where per-line wrapping matches block-narrowing result.\n\nADR-074 estimated Bug B contributed ~565px. Direct measurement shows\n~0px on this article. ADR-079 is a prerequisite, not a fix, for\nHistory's y≈500 target.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-11-24T06:17:36Z",
